This product is an independent, minimal launcher for the Reunion (重聚未来)
Red Alert 2 / Yuri's Revenge client.

Behavior, configuration formats and launch flow were studied from
Snowy-Studio/RF-Client (https://github.com/Snowy-Studio/RF-Client, GPLv3).
No source code from that project is included here.

The application icon is taken from the Reunion client distribution
(Resources/clienticon.ico).

